{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/312","id":5161812325,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVgdJU88AAAABM6sBZQ","html_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/312","diff_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/312.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/312.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/312","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/312/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/312/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/312/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/statuses/9d566946208e46a1cccd606cbf9398b1d8d48de5","number":312,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add ratchet dispenser cartridge replacement task","user":{"login":"alesspalma","id":48835050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODM1MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48835050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma","html_url":"https://github.com/alesspalma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alesspalma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds a cartridge replacement task for an unpowered ratchet-rod dispenser at a bimanual YAM workbench. The robot disengages and retracts the piston rod, collects the used refill, seats the prepared replacement, and restores the working configuration with the tool in its cradle and both hands released. The free tool, passive pawl, sawteeth, rod joints and seating contacts use native physics. Numeric endpoint scoring gives partial credit and permanently invalidates parts leaving the work area.\n\nValidation uses the same executable source and fixed seed-0 layout:\n\n- Native scripted demo: 1.0 in 1,090 actions / 54.50 simulated seconds; registered Inspect Robots runner: 1.0 in 1,089 actions.\n- Single Dream-1 trial: 0.0 after the 2,400-action / 120-second limit, normal termination and zero trial errors. No second trial was run.\n- Twelve scorer/envelope tests, four offline plans and four USD structure checks pass. Validation receipts, exact setup/reset, commands, runtimes and fidelity limits are included.\n\nThe actual model video, full-score demo and matching initial screenshot are uploaded as media M-GX5B82. Both videos are H.264 and include every recorded observation. Category: Impact on jobs. All changes are confined to tasks/sealant-cartridge-reload/.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-04T21:21:18Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:58:27Z","closed_at":"2026-11-12T04:58:27Z","merged_at":"2026-11-12T04:58:27Z","merge_commit_sha":"7541cfd225a03056b64668e696e7de6c21ae7171","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"alesspalma:sealant-cartridge-reload","ref":"sealant-cartridge-reload","repo":{"id":1445395348,"node_id":"R_kgDOVib7lA","name":"benchmark-tasks","full_name":"alesspalma/benchmark-tasks","owner":{"login":"alesspalma","id":48835050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODM1MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48835050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.git